<p style="text-align: center; margin-right: -0.1pt; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>ANAYASA MAHKEMESİ KARARI</strong></span></p>
<p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.0;">​</p>
<p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.0;">​</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.0; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>Esas Sayısı</strong> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> <strong>:</strong></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> <strong>2024/49 (Siyasi Parti Mali Denetimi)</strong></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.0; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>Karar</strong> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>Sayısı :</strong></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> <strong>2025/154</strong></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.0; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>Karar</strong> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>Tarihi :</strong></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>25/12/2025</strong></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.0; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>R.</strong></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>G.Tarih</strong></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>-Sayı : 20/4/2026-33</strong></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>230</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>I. MALİ DENETİMİN KONUSU</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Emek Partisi</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">nin </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2023</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> yılı kesin hesabının incelenmesidir.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>II. İLK İNCELEME</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">1. </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Anayasa Mahkemesi İ&ccedil;</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">t</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">&uuml;z&uuml;ğ&uuml;</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> h&uuml;k&uuml;mleri</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> uyarınca </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Kadir &Ouml;ZKAYA, Hasan Tahsin G&Ouml;KCAN, Basri BAĞCI, Engin YILDIRIM, Rıdvan G&Uuml;LE&Ccedil;, Recai AKYEL, Yusuf Şevki HAKYEMEZ, Yıldız SEFERİNOĞLU, Selahaddin MENTEŞ, İrfan FİDAN, Kenan YAŞAR, Muhterem İNCE, Yılmaz AK&Ccedil;İL, &Ouml;mer &Ccedil;INAR </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">ve</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> Metin </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">KIRATLI&rsquo;nın</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">katılım</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">lar</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">ıyla </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">27/3/2025</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">tarihinde yapılan ilk inceleme toplantısında</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">;</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2.</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Emek Partisi</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">nin </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2023</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> yılı kesin hesabının incelenmesi sonucunda;</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>A.</strong></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> Dosyada eksiklik bulunmadığından işin esasının incelenmesine,</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>B.</strong></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> Esas incelemenin yapılması i&ccedil;in Genel Merkez kesin hesabının dayanağını oluşturan gelir ve gider belgeleri ile bu belgelerin kaydedildiği defterleri Sayıştay Başkanlığına g&ouml;ndermesi i&ccedil;in Partiye bu kararın tebliğinden itibaren otuz g&uuml;n s&uuml;re verilmesine,</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">OYBİRLİĞİYLE karar verilmiştir.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>III. ESASIN İNCELENMESİ</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-top: 5.0pt; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">3</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">. </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Emek Partisi</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">nin Anayasa Mahkemesine verdiği </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2023</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> yılı kesin hesap &ccedil;izelgeleri ile dayanağını oluşturan defter ve belgeler &uuml;zerinde yapılan inceleme sonu&ccedil;larını i&ccedil;eren ve Sayıştay Başkanlığınca hazırlanıp Raport&ouml;r </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Oğuz &Ccedil;AKAR</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> tarafından Heyete sunulan esas inceleme raporu, Anayasa&rsquo;nın </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">ve </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">30/3/2011 tarihli ve 6216 sayılı Anayasa Mahkemesinin Kuruluşu ve Yargılama Usulleri Hakkında Kanun ile 22/4/1983 tarihli ve 2820 sayılı Siyasi Partiler Kanunu&rsquo;nun ilgili kuralları, bunların gerek&ccedil;eleri ve diğer yasama belgeleri okunup incelendikten sonra gereği g&ouml;r&uuml;ş&uuml;l&uuml;p d&uuml;ş&uuml;n&uuml;ld&uuml;:</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-top: 5.0pt; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">4</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">. </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Denetimin maddi &ouml;gelerini oluşturan defter ve belgelerden</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> Partinin </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2023 yılı gelirleri toplamı 2.862.621,96 TL, bir &ouml;nceki yıldan devreden nakit toplamı 59.537,96 TL olmak &uuml;zere gelir genel toplamının </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2.922.159,92</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> TL; 2023 yılı giderleri toplamı 2.793.178,27 TL, gelecek yıla devreden nakit toplamı 128.981,65 TL olmak &uuml;zere gider genel toplamının 2.922.159,92 TL olduğu </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">anlaşılmıştır.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">5</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">. Partinin </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2023</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> yılı kesin hesabının gelir ve gider rakamlarının yukarıda a&ccedil;ıklanan tutarlardan</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">oluştuğu, bu h&acirc;liyle </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2023</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> yılı kesin hesabının doğru, denk ve 2820 sayılı Kanun&rsquo;a uygun olduğu sonucuna varılmıştır.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 5.5pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>A.</strong></span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>Gelirlerin İncelenmesi</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 5.5pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>1. Genel Merkez Gelirleri</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 5.5pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">6</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">. Partinin Genel Merkez gelirleri toplamı </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">427.995</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">TL </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">olup bu </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">tutarın 277.995 TL&rsquo;si &uuml;ye yıllık aidat</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">lar</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">ından, 150.000 TL&rsquo;si bağışlardan oluşmaktadır. </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Parti Genel Merkezinin bir &ouml;nceki</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> yıldan devreden nakit toplamının </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">34.285,82</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">TL olduğu anlaşılmıştır. </span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 5.5pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">7</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">. Parti Genel Merkezinin defter kayıtları ve gelir belgeleri &uuml;zerinde yapılan inceleme neticesinde gelirlerin 2820 sayılı Kanun&rsquo;a uygun olarak sağlandığı sonucuna varılmıştır.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 5.5pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>2. İl &Ouml;rg&uuml;tleri Gelirleri</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 5.5pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">8. Partinin il &ouml;rg&uuml;tlerinin gelirleri toplamı </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2.434.626,96</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">TL </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">olup </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">bu tutarın 2.261.676,45 TL&rsquo;si &uuml;ye yıllık aidat</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">lar</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">ından, 172.950,51 TL&rsquo;si bağış ve yardımlardan oluşmaktadır. </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Parti il &ouml;rg&uuml;tlerinin </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">bir &ouml;nceki</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> yıldan devreden nakit t</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">oplamının</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">5.505 </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">TL </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">olduğu anlaşılmıştır.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 5.5pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">9. Parti il &ouml;rg&uuml;tlerinin defter kayıtları ve gelir belgeleri &uuml;zerinde yapılan inceleme neticesinde gelirlerin 2820 sayılı Kanun&rsquo;a uygun olarak ger&ccedil;ekleştirildiği sonucuna varılmıştır.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 5.5pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>B. Giderlerin İncelenmesi</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 5.5pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>1. Genel Merkez Giderleri</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 5.5pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">10</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">. </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Partinin Genel Merkez giderleri toplamı </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">392.616,58 </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">olup </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">bu </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">tutarın 30.000 TL&rsquo;si temsil ağırlama giderlerinden, 1.910,25 TL&rsquo;si haberleşme giderlerinden, 22.711,33 TL&rsquo;si ısıtma, aydınlatma giderlerinden, 337.995 TL&rsquo;si kira giderlerinden oluşmaktadır. </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Parti </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">G</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">enel </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">M</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">erkezi</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">nin</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> gelecek yıla devreden nakit toplamı</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">nın</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">69.664,24</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">TL</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> olduğu anlaşılmıştır.</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 5.5pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">11</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">. Parti Genel Merkezinin defter kayıtları ve gider belgeleri &uuml;zerinde yapılan inceleme neticesinde giderlerin 2820 sayılı Kanun&rsquo;a uygun olarak ger&ccedil;ekleştirildiği sonucuna varılmıştır.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 5.5pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>2. İl &Ouml;rg&uuml;tleri Giderleri</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 5.5pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">12. </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Partinin il &ouml;rg&uuml;tlerinin giderleri toplamı </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2.400.561,69 </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">TL olup </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">bu </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">tutarın 1.709.798,77 TL&rsquo;si kira giderlerinden, 44.210,87 TL&rsquo;si haberleşme giderlerinden, 19.120,12 TL&rsquo;si temsil ağırlama giderlerinden,18.445,30 TL&rsquo;si basın yayın giderlerinden, 120.200,25 TL&rsquo;si b&uuml;ro giderlerinden, 153.036,75 TL&rsquo;si temizlik giderlerinden, 277.995 TL&rsquo;si teşkilata yardım giderlerinden, 17.895</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">TL&rsquo;si seyahat giderlerinden, 19.550 TL&rsquo;si bakım onarım giderlerinden, 20.309,63</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">TL&rsquo;si ise vergi ve sigorta giderlerinden oluşmaktadır. </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Parti il &ouml;rg&uuml;tlerinin gelecek yıla devreden nakit toplamının </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">59.317,41</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> TL olduğu anlaşılmıştır.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 5.5pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">13. Parti il &ouml;rg&uuml;tlerinin defter kayıtları ve gider belgeleri &uuml;zerinde yapılan inceleme neticesinde giderlerin 2820 sayılı Kanun&rsquo;a uygun olarak ger&ccedil;ekleştirildiği sonucuna varılmıştır.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 4.5pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>C. Parti Mallarının İncelenmesi</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-bottom: 4.5pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">14</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">. </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Emek Partisi</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">nin </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2023</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> yılı defter ve belgeleri &uuml;zerinde yapılan inceleme neticesinde </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">herhangi bir taşınır ve taşınmaz mal ile menkul kıymet ediniminin olmadığı anlaşılmıştır.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-right: -0.1pt; margin-bottom: 5.0pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"><strong>IV. SONU&Ccedil;</strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; margin-right: -0.1pt; margin-bottom: 5.0pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Emek Partisi</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">nin </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2023</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> yılı kesin hesabının incelenmesi sonucunda;</span></p>
<p style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 42.55pt; line-height: 1.1; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Partinin </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2023</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> yılı kesin hesabında g&ouml;sterilen </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2.862.621,96 </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">TL d&ouml;nem i&ccedil;i gelir, </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">59.537,96 </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">TL </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">bir &ouml;nceki </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">yıldan devreden nakit toplamı olmak &uuml;zere </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2.922.159,92</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> TL </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">gelir genel toplamı ile </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2.793.178,27 </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">TL </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">d&ouml;nem i&ccedil;i </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">gider</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">, </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">128.981,65 </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">TL gelecek yıla devreden nakit toplamı olmak &uuml;zere </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">2.922.159,92</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;"> </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">TL gider </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">genel toplamının eldeki bilgi ve belgelere g&ouml;re doğru, denk ve 22/4/1983 tarihli ve 2820 sayılı Siyasi Partiler Kanunu&rsquo;na uygun olduğuna </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">25/12/2025 tarihinde OYBİRLİĞİYLE karar verildi.</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0; padding: 0; height: 12pt; line-height: 12pt; font-size: 1pt;">​</p>
<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: auto; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;" width="100%">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0; border: none;">
<div align="center">
<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: auto; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;" width="100%" align="center">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 33.333333333333336%; padding: 1pt 6pt; border: none; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;">
<div style="line-height: 1.05;">
<p style="text-align: center; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times New Roman;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Başkan</span></p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times New Roman;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Kadir &Ouml;ZKAYA</span></p>
</div>
</td>
<td style="width: 33.333333333333336%; padding: 1pt 6pt; border: none; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;">
<div style="line-height: 1.05;">
<p style="text-align: center; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times New Roman;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Başkanvekili</span></p>
<p style="text-align: center; margin-left: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; line-height: 1.0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times New Roman;"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman;">Hasan Tahsin G&Ouml;KCAN</span></p>
